<title>FINLAND: NOKIA ADR ENDS FLAT AT $51 (FIM 231.52).</title>
<headline>NOKIA ADR ENDS FLAT AT $51 (FIM 231.52).</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nokia's A share ADR was unchanged at $51 in New York on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Its Wall Street closing equals about 231.52 markka. In Helsinki on Wednesday Nokia A closed three markka lower at 227.00.</p>
<p>Valmet's ADR (two shares) closed down $0-1/8 31-3/4 on Wall Street. The price equals about 72.07 markka. In Helsinki, Valmet closed flat at 73.00.</p>
<p>Rauma's ADR was untraded in New York on Tuesday. In Helsinki, Rauma closed down 0.50 markka at 87.50.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358-0-680 50 245</p>
</text>
